  "description": "ONATOO crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C132 H107 Dy4 N6 O17 1-,C6 H16 N1 1+,4(C1 H4 O1),H2 O1,C2 H3 N1. From the CIF bond table, Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.449-3.513 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.93-96.31°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C132H107Dy4N6O17·C6H16N·solvents (table formula C144H144Dy4N8O22).",
